    "AI 助手停下来等你确认时，项目会出现在这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Projects appear here when an AI assistant stops and waits for your confirmation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 助理停下來等你確認時，專案會出現在這裡。"
