    "从 GitHub Releases 检查，每天最多一次，不上传任何信息。codedog 没有开发者签名，新版本需要手动下载替换。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checks GitHub Releases at most once a day and never uploads any data. codedog isn’t signed by a developer, so new versions must be downloaded and replaced manually."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從 GitHub Releases 檢查，每天最多一次，不會上傳任何資訊。codedog 沒有開發者簽名，新版本需要手動下載替換。"
          }
        }
      }
